%% Long state labels: Mermaid 11.17.2 wraps a description, a quoted name, a
%% transition label and a note at 200px, and leaves a composite's title on one row.

[*] --> Waiting
Waiting : The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog and keeps running far away
state "a state whose quoted display name is long enough to wrap" as Named
Waiting --> Named : this transition label is long enough to go well past two hundred pixels wide
note right of Named : The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog and keeps running far away
state "a composite whose title is far too long to fit on a single row" as Outer {
  [*] --> Inside
  Inside --> [*]
}
Named --> Outer
Outer --> [*]
